---
import ServiceCard from './ServiceCard.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-[hsl(0,0%,96%)] scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[hsl(180,15%,88%)] bg-white/90 p-8 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] backdrop-blur sm:p-10">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-[hsl(176,35%,63%)]/12 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[hsl(176,56%,28%)]">
            About Chamfered
          </span>
          <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold text-[hsl(0,0%,9%)] sm:text-4xl">
            Products engineered for useful, everyday results.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-[hsl(0,0%,32%)]">
            Hi, I'm Jaeseo. I design and sell functional 3D prints and digital files created to solve
            real-world problems. Whether it's a custom tool, a specific hardware adapter, or an
            everyday fix, I build things that actually work.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-[hsl(0,0%,44%)]">
            Chamfered now carries the same full-site storefront feel across the landing page, catalog, and product details while still preserving the current purchase and download schema behavior.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <ServiceCard icon="document-outline" title="Digital Files">
            Ready-to-print STL files for your own machine.{' '}
            <a
              href="https://makerworld.com/en/@jaeseopark/upload"
              class="text-[hsl(176,35%,50%)] hover:underline font-medium"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer noopener"
            >Browse the MakerWorld shop</a>.
          </ServiceCard>

          <ServiceCard icon="pencil-outline" title="Custom Design">
            Bespoke CAD modeling to create specific parts you can't find elsewhere.{' '}
            <a href="#" data-email-obfuscate class="text-[hsl(176,35%,50%)] hover:underline font-medium">
              Email me
            </a>{' '}
            to start your project.
          </ServiceCard>

          <ServiceCard icon="cube-outline" title="Physical Goods">
            Durable, 3D-printed items shipped directly to you.{' '}
            <a
              href="#"
              class="text-[hsl(176,35%,50%)] hover:underline font-medium"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer noopener"
            >See the Etsy catalog</a>.<sup><a href="#direct-order" class="text-[hsl(176,35%,50%)]">*</a></sup>
          </ServiceCard>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[hsl(180,15%,88%)] bg-[hsl(42,33%,98%)] p-6">
        <p id="direct-order" class="mb-4 border-b border-[hsl(0,0%,90%)] pb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[hsl(0,0%,44%)]">
          <strong class="text-[hsl(0,0%,30%)]">*</strong> I am always open to working out a deal outside of Etsy to bypass
          platform fees and pass those savings directly to you. For custom designs, bulk orders, or direct
          purchases, <a href="#" data-email-obfuscate class="text-[hsl(176,35%,50%)] hover:underline font-medium">email me</a> with what you are looking to buy!
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[hsl(0,0%,44%)]">
          I also provide <strong class="text-[hsl(0,0%,30%)]">Software Consulting</strong> for web applications
          and server-side development. If you have a technical project or need help with backend architecture,
          feel free to get in touch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
